    987  f187							; the ball latch twice per frame — same
    988  f187							; discipline; bank1 HUD has no room for it)
    989  f187							; Bomb save/restore deleted (S3.0b): BuildColupF writes rows 0-2 only
    990  f187							; (TILE_ROWS=3) — nothing touched $F0-$F2 between the old save and
    991  f187							; restore (window audited: zero writers), so the round trip was a no-op.
