   1967  f5e5							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   1968  f5e5							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   1969  f5e5							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   1970  f5e5							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   1971  f5e5							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   1972  f5e5							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   1973  f5e5							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
