   2265  f746							; CallPad_RaftBody — bank1 RaftBody entry. Pinned at $F8C0 with a
   2266  f746							; BYTE-IDENTICAL twin in bank1 (bank1.asm, same address): the `sta $1FF7`
   2267  f746							; switches banks, so the `jmp` opcode AND its operand are fetched from bank1,
