   2506  f9af							; OverlayTramp gates on LineCount ($84 = packed byte, VBL/$8F staged):
   2507  f9af							; symmetric rooms pay +8c and return here-shaped clc/rts; asym rooms
   2508  f9af							; cross to bank2 PHMOverlay (patch column + band mask), exit via
   2509  f9af							; ReturnPad $FBF8 — rts pops THIS call's return (0 pushes total, SP
   2510  f9af							; guard unchanged). Overlay sets C itself (plain sec — patch cells are
   2511  f9af							; envelope-guaranteed non-hot, so HotOverlapFlag must not run).
