   2850  fadc							; solid. A door strip is solid until the key is held, then the touch
   2851  fadc							; destroys it (EnemyDeadMask b3) and the walk passes (Phase 5).
   2852  fadc							; Kill follows the VISIBLE right-half block only (async ruling 2026-10-14 —
