   3319  fd38							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3320  fd38							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   3321  fd38							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   3322  fd38							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   3323  fd38							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   3324  fd38							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   3325  fd38							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3326  fd38							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3327  fd38							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3328  fd38							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3329  fd38							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3330  fd38							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   3331  fd38							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3332  fd38							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3333  fd38							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3334  fd38							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
