   3555  fe00							; SelectActiveObject frame colors — no visual change for enemies/lamp/bomb);
   3556  fe00							; MINER slot = miner.png purple/pink/grey -> nearest NTSC $54/$4A/$08.
   3557  fe00							; NOTE: dark rooms no longer force grey objects — the frame-level $0A write
   3558  fe00							; is overridden per row (no budget for a dark skip flag; see .Line probe).
