   3934  ffe6							; TallyTramp ($FFE6, byte-identical with BANK1 now — the body moved there in
   3935  ffe6							; repack chunk 3, 2026-10-20; guard: verify_build). bank0 jsr's here
   3936  ffe6							; (CheckMinerPickup arm / TallyWork step): `sta $1FF7` selects bank1, then the
   3937  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   3938  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   3939  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
   3940  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
